  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/4BPw/66",
  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단체로 주문했던 하복 체육복이 도착하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">점심시간에 나누어 주려고 급식실과 홈베이스의 중간 지점에서 기다리고 있었어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">멀리서 저를 발견한 우리 반 아이들이 공중부양하며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(?) </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">달려오기 시작하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">와</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">체육복이다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자신의 이름표가 붙은 체육복을 찾더니 당장 입어볼 기세로 포장을 뜯습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명품을 특가에 득템하였다 해도 이 보다 더 행복한 표정을 지을 수는 없었을 겁니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">체육복을 가져가면서</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제게</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고맙습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 했어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제돈 내고 구입한 체육복인데 담임샘이 왜 고마운걸까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">? ^^ </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 얘기를 보건샘에게 전해주었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">보건실에서 주문한 약품상자가 도착하면 치료받던 우리 반 아이들이 환호성을 지르며 반갑게 맞이한대요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아파서 보건실 왔다는 사실을 잊었는지 상자를 옮겨주려고까지 한답니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리 반이 담당한 청소 구역 중에 화장실이 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생 수는 적고 구역은 넓다 보니</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">전교 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학급</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">화장실을 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명이 담당합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">꾀를 부리지 않고 어찌나 열심히 청소하는지</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(EM</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사용은 기본이고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">어디를 보아도 티 하나 없니 말끔해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.) </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">기특하고 안쓰럽기도 하여 상으로 자장면을 사주겠다고 했습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그날따라 공문처리 건이 많아 음식이 오면 저는 학교로 돌아가기로 했고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주문한 짬뽕</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자장면을 기다리는 동안 아이들이 반찬을 예쁘게 담아왔습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제 앞에 물 컵을 놓으면서 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저희들만 먹어서 어떻게 해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시원한 물이라도 드세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지금까지 과학반을 포함하여 아이들과 같은 식탁에 앉은 적이 꽤 있었는데 올해 아이들처럼 살갑게 표현하는 경우는 드물었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">심지어 선생님이 사주는 것이 아니라 창의재단에서 동아리 지원금을 받은 것이 아니냐고 말하는 아이도 있었거든요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">체육대회 상금으로 매점 이용권을 받았습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지들이 좋다는 걸로 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1/n</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">씩 맛있는 것을 사서 이미 나누어 먹었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">부담임샘까지 챙기는 모습이 예뻤습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. 2</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">천원은 담임 몫이라고 하여 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">백 원짜리 과자 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">봉지를 샀습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">언젠가 그 과자를 줄 대상이 나타날 거라 믿으며 보관하고 있었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">중간고사 첫 날 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교시 자습시간에 교실에 갔더니 한 녀석이 과자를 먹고 있더군요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시험 공부하는데 목이 막히지 않느냐고 물었더니 과자를 조금 먹으면 기억력이 좋아지더라고 일제히 한 목소리를 냈습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">순간 과자 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">봉지 생각이 나서 가져왔습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시험대형 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">줄</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">젤 앞에 앉은 아이들에게 한 봉지씩 주었더니</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일제히</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우와</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">잘 먹을게요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고맙습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 하네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다행히 조리퐁을 닮아 나누어먹기 좋은 과자였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저만 이런 일에 감동 받을까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">? </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">언제부터인지는 잘 기억이 나지 않지만</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(10</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년은 더 된 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.) </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시간과 수고로움 그리고 돈을 들여도 웬만해서는 단체로 고맙다는 반응은 없었거든요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">세젤예</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">들이 작은 과자 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">봉지에 감동이라는 선물로 돌려주네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 간식을 업그레이드하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">마트에 갔더니 국산딸기와 산딸기 잼이 듬뿍 들었다는 낱개 포장된 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">00</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 눈에 띄어 두 박스를 샀습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이러다가 울 반 아이들</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">기억력이 너무 좋아져서 나머지 과목 단체로 만점 받는 건 아닐까요? ㅎㅎ</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
